  & = \\dfrac{2}{6} + \\dfrac{1}{6}
\\end{aligned}
[1] + num.
    │ \\begin{aligned}
  & \\textcolor{blue}{\\dfrac{2}{6} + \\dfrac{1}{6}} \\\\
  & = \\dfrac{3}{6}
\\end{aligned}
